Package: rankACFbands
Type: Package
Title: Rank Autocorrelations and Simultaneous Inference Bands
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Jan-Lukas", "Wermuth", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "wermuth@econ.uni-frankfurt.de")
Description: Estimates classical and generalized rank autocorrelations with
    explicit treatment of ties. Implements independence significance bands,
    rank Box-Pierce tests, heteroskedasticity and autocorrelation consistent
    covariance estimation, delta-method inference, and Gaussian sup-t bands.
    Methods follow the September 29, 2026 draft 'Rank Autocorrelations' by
    Pohle, Weiss and Wermuth; implementation decisions are documented in the
    package guide. Includes one-sided simultaneous bands and general Wald tests.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, grDevices, utils, mvtnorm, DescTools
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
